# Changelog Entry

`gmeow:ChangelogEntry` · Class

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| CURIE | `gmeow:ChangelogEntry` |
| IRI | `https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChangelogEntry` |
| Category | Class |
| Slice | [GMEOW Versions Module](../../slices/versions/index.md) |

![completeness: Docs 10/17](../../badges/completeness/10.svg) ![stability: experimental](../../badges/stability/experimental.svg) ![category: Class](../../badges/category/class.svg) ![box: TBox](../../badges/box/boxtbox.svg) ![stereotype: Kind](../../badges/stereotype/kind.svg)

## Definition

A reified record of one change to a vocabulary term in a given release — a first\-class information object carrying a version \(gmeow:entryVersion\) and optional prose \(gmeow:entryNote\)\. Attached to a term through the gmeow:hasChangelogEntry annotation, so a term accrues an ordered per\-release history without any per\-instance lifecycle modelling\.

## For developers

## Quickstart

```turtle
<subject> a gmeow:ChangelogEntry .
```

